<form method="POST" action={actions.newsletter}>
```

### Image Endpoint Configuration
```javascript
// Old
image: { endpoint: './src/image-endpoint.ts' }
// New
image: {
  endpoint: {
    route: "/image",
    entrypoint: "./src/image_endpoint.ts"
  }
}
```

### Markdown charset Behavior
Astro no longer auto-adds `charset=utf-8` response header. Add `<meta charset="utf-8">` to layout components manually.

### API Changes (Integration/Adapter APIs)
- `RouteData` replaced by `IntegrationsRouteData`
- `distURL` changed to array type
- `app.render()` arguments updated
- Dev Toolbar app definition shape deprecated
- TypeScript configuration during `create-astro` removed

### URL Handling
- `paginate()` URLs now include configured `base` value automatically
- Route parameters no longer URL-decoded
- Non-boolean HTML attributes processed differently

## Experimental Flags Removed

These features are now defaults or removed entirely:
- `env` (moved to root config)
- `serverIslands` (enabled by default)
- `directRenderScript` (enabled by default)
- `globalRoutePriority` (enabled by default)
- `contentLayer` (recommended; migrate legacy collections)
- `contentCollectionsCache` (removed entirely)

Remove experimental flags from config and relocate `env` schema to root level.

## Testing After Upgrade

- Verify content displays correctly on collection-using pages
- Test routing for collisions (Astro logs warnings)
- Check script execution order and styling
- Validate form actions work as expected
- Review TypeScript completion for type improvements

